# Blocklist of the squid-noauth E2E instance (the directory is mounted at /etc/squid/lists,
# as the control plane does). both.example.internal is on both lists: the blocklist wins.
# .a.blocked.example.com and the bare apex: entries squid 6 refuses next to their parent.
.a.blocked.example.com
blocked.example.com
.blocked.example.com
.both.example.internal
